                    <div class="policy-details">
                        <!-- Booking & Payment -->
                        <section id="booking" class="policy-subsection">
                            <h2>Booking & Payment</h2>
                            <h3>Booking Requirements</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>A completed booking form with all required information</li>
                                <li>Valid passport with at least 6 months validity from travel date</li>
                                <li>Confirmation of travel dates and number of participants</li>
                            </ul>
                            
                            <h3>Payment Terms</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>A non-refundable deposit of 30% is required to confirm your booking</li>
                                <li>The remaining 70% balance is due 30 days before departure</li>
                                <li>We accept bank transfers, credit cards, and mobile payment options</li>
                                <li>Late payments may result in cancellation of reservation</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3>Price Protection</h3>
                            <p>Prices are confirmed upon receipt of deposit. Exchange rate fluctuations after booking confirmation are not refundable.</p>
                        </section>

                        <!-- Cancellation Policy -->
                        <section id="cancellation" class="policy-subsection">
                            <h2>Cancellation Policy</h2>
                            <p>The following refund schedule applies to cancellations made in writing:</p>
                            
                            <table class="policy-table">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Days Before Travel</th>
                                        <th>Refund Amount</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>90+ days</td>
                                        <td>100% refund minus booking fee</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>60-89 days</td>
                                        <td>80% refund</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>30-59 days</td>
                                        <td>50% refund</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>15-29 days</td>
                                        <td>25% refund</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>Less than 15 days</td>
                                        <td>No refund</td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>

                            <h3>Special Circumstances</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Medical emergencies may qualify for exceptions. Documentation required.</li>
                                <li>Death in immediate family may qualify for rebooking without penalty</li>
                                <li>Travel restrictions due to government actions are subject to case-by-case review</li>
                            </ul>
                        </section>

                        <!-- Modifications -->
                        <section id="modifications" class="policy-subsection">
                            <h2>Modifications & Changes</h2>
                            <h3>Itinerary Changes</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Changes requested 60+ days before travel: Small administrative fee applies</li>
                                <li>Changes requested 30-59 days before travel: 10% change fee applies</li>
                                <li>Changes requested less than 30 days before travel: Subject to availability with applicable fees</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3>Date Changes</h3>
                            <p>Rebooking to different dates may incur additional costs based on season and availability. Premium season (July-September) changes may include surcharges.</p>
                        </section>

                        <!-- Requirements -->
                        <section id="requirements" class="policy-subsection">
                            <h2>Travel Requirements</h2>
                            <h3>Documentation</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Valid passport with 6+ months validity beyond travel dates</li>
                                <li>Required visas for your country of origin</li>
                                <li>Travel insurance (highly recommended)</li>
                                <li>Yellow fever vaccination certificate (if required)</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3>Entry Permits</h3>
                            <p>Travelers are responsible for obtaining all necessary visas and permits. We provide guidance but cannot process applications on your behalf.</p>

                            <h3>Vaccinations</h3>
                            <p>Yellow fever vaccination is recommended. Consult your healthcare provider for other recommended vaccinations before travel to East Africa.</p>
                        </section>

                        <!-- Health & Safety -->
                        <section id="safety" class="policy-subsection">
                            <h2>Health & Safety</h2>
                            <h3>Medical Fitness</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Participants must be in good health to participate in safari activities</li>
                                <li>We recommend consulting your physician before travel</li>
                                <li>Pregnancy after 6 months is generally not recommended for safari travel</li>
                                <li>Inform us of any medical conditions when booking</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3>Safety Protocols</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Follow all instructions from professional guides at all times</li>
                                <li>Do not approach, feed, or touch wildlife under any circumstances</li>
                                <li>Stay within safari vehicles during game drives</li>
                                <li>Respect wildlife and maintain safe distances as advised</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3>Travel Insurance</h3>
                            <p>We strongly recommend comprehensive travel insurance covering medical evacuation, trip cancellation, and personal belongings. Insurance is available at booking.</p>
                        </section>

                        <!-- Liability & Insurance -->
                        <section id="liability" class="policy-subsection">
                            <h2>Liability & Insurance</h2>
                            <p>Safari Adventures operates under East African tourism regulations. Our liability is limited to the cost of services provided. We are not responsible for:</p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Personal accidents, injuries, or illnesses</li>
                                <li>Loss, theft, or damage to personal belongings</li>
                                <li>Flight delays or cancellations (not under our control)</li>
                                <li>Actions or negligence of third-party service providers</li>
                                <li>Weather-related disruptions to activities</li>
                                <li>Natural disasters or unforeseeable circumstances</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3>Our Responsibility</h3>
                            <p>We maintain comprehensive liability insurance and follow strict safety protocols. Our professional guides are trained in first aid and emergency procedures.</p>
                        </section>

                        <!-- Force Majeure -->
                        <section id="force-majeure" class="policy-subsection">
                            <h2>Force Majeure</h2>
                            <p>In cases of unforeseeable circumstances (natural disasters, pandemics, war, extreme weather), we reserve the right to:</p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Modify or cancel tours with full refund or alternative dates</li>
                                <li>Relocate activities to alternative locations</li>
                                <li>Postpone travel if conditions are unsafe</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3>COVID-19 & Health Restrictions</h3>
                            <p>If government restrictions prevent travel or require isolation, we offer full rebooking flexibility without penalties within 12 months of original travel date.</p>
                        </section>
                    </div>
